SUMMARY:The Hip Snacks with Sauce City
LOCATION:Hill Country Live\, Midtown South-Flatiron-Union Square
DESCRIPTION:The Hip Snacks have once again captured their infectious energy
 
 in a way that's both timeless and urgent with their upcoming second album 
 
Out On A Limb\, out NOW. Fresh off the success of their second national tou
 
r supporting the album\, recorded once again with legendary producer Steve 
 
Avedis\, The Hip Snacks are not just a local gem anymore---they're a nation
 
al sensation\, tearing across the country packing venues and leaving crowds
 
 buzzing. Comprised of lead singer Kara Durante and her husband bassist Ben
 
 Suarez\, guitarists Ricky Feria and Felipe Cantuaria\, drummer Dave Auerba
 
ch\, and keyboardist Adam Schini\, The Hip Snacks are more than a band\; th
 
ey're a movement---a feel-good revolution that's growing faster than you ca
 
n keep up. Catch them live\, and you'll understand why their audiences leav
 
e craving more. See the band at their upcoming festival stops\, including E
 
agle River Jamboree and Ramble Fest\, as well as shows across Colorado thro
 
ugh year's end. You don't just hear The Hip Snacks---you experience them. A
 
nd trust us\, you deserve this snack. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb
 
.com/event/the-hip-snacks-with-sauce-hill-country-live-tickets/14257154
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-hip-snacks-with-sauce-hill-country-
 
live-tickets/14257154
